{"verify_memory_ids":["memory_73"],"intended_action":"simplify_onboarding","rationale":"Two of the three signals are funnel-health problems I own directly: onboarding completion -4% and activation -6% QoQ. memory_86 (shortening onboarding lifted completion and time-to-value) and memory_31 (signup simplification produced a durable first-week activation lift) both point at the same lever and reinforce each other, and onboarding sits upstream of activation, so one fix plausibly moves both metrics. That makes simplify_onboarding the best single bet for sustainable qualified revenue.

