I am deliberately not verifying memory_86, even though it is the memory I intend to act on, because confirming it would not change my action, and its claim is corroborated by memory_31 plus live evidence that the metric it governs is currently degrading. Note also that reacting to competitor price pressure with a price cut is the move that leaves the two measured internal declines unaddressed while permanently repricing the SMB segment; fixing the funnel improves the value delivered per account, which is the more durable answer to a cheaper competitor.","confidence":74}
